From 522be794dbd01767e1630303c633dd0d9bb20baf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Felix=20F=C3=B6rtsch?= <mail@felixfoertsch.de>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 14:49:50 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat: add simple download-only metadata embedding

Add Off, Full and Simple embedding modes while preserving existing
boolean settings. Simple writes static title, artist, description and
thumbnail only when a video is downloaded; later refreshes leave media
files untouched. Full retains the existing archive and artwork behavior.

Include embedding regression tests and initialize the download-queue
test configuration. Exercise all three modes so ignored videos never
enter the download-only embedding path and normal downloads still do.
